# No LFS anywhere. Every clip the render touches — job avatars, staged b-roll,
# the meme bank, the music and SFX banks — is stored as real bytes, because a
# GitHub Actions runner clones this repo and reads those files directly. An LFS
# pointer would arrive as a 130-byte text file and the render would silently
# come out without the asset.
*.mp4 -filter -diff -merge -text
*.webm -filter -diff -merge -text
*.mov -filter -diff -merge -text
*.mp3 -filter -diff -merge -text
*.wav -filter -diff -merge -text
